      en: ["Construction of the Castillo del Morro fortress began in 1638.", "The first lighthouse at this specific site was established in 1842.", "The focal plane of the lighthouse light is 64 meters above sea level.", "The light signal has a nominal range of approximately 20 nautical miles.", "The tower has been renovated several times following regional earthquake damage.", "The entire fortress complex was designated a UNESCO World Heritage site in 1997."],
